    {
      "text": "Notice of Exemption: 24 three-story townhome buildings totaling 134 units, including 14 adaptable units, and a one-story clubhouse. Exempt under Public Resources Code 21155.4 as consistent with the Gateway-Main Street Specific Plan Subsequent EIR (SCH 2024070432).",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002808"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "San Jose Spotlight (2023): the site houses the Sobrato Centers for Nonprofits and is owned by the Silicon Valley Community Foundation, with Sobrato processing land use permits. The 2023 concept was 244 homes: about 104 market-rate townhomes on 5.62 acres and about 140 affordable apartments on a 1.6-acre parcel to be dedicated to the city, where an existing nonprofit office building stands.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002807"
      ]
    }
